# Sixteen counters, one a MAC: the seventeenth group joined has none, and its
# flow is unknown however long it stays (never lost). When one of the first
# sixteen leaves, its counter goes to the seventeenth on the next second,
# which is unknown until that counter grows, and up once it does.
